Synthetic ORCA-style output for the Kinisot test suite (see README.md): the
$hessian block of claisen_gs.hess is the Gaussian B3LYP/6-31G(d) Hessian of the
Claisen example written in ORCA's layout, so that the ORCA reader can be
tested against the Gaussian golden values.

